d`, `clj.py/mul`, `clj.py/add`, `clj.py/eq` (exact `yin.vm.integer` / `yrt.float` paths).\n765:| **P1 — Layer 2a Tier 1 (`yrt.escape`, `yrt.float`, `yrt.int`)** | Implement the three stateless guest modules (frame indexing via `data/nth`, status-returning `yrt.float` boxed boundaries `neg-pow-result` / `floor-int-result` plus total `float-floor-raw` with zero raw-double callbacks and no `data/float64?` dependency); migrate `js`/`clj` from 4-slot to 5-slot contexts (`:handlers :depth :base :frame`); preserve open non-`:finally` (`:generator`) boundary dispatch; add `dsg__add`/`dsg__lte` guest helpers for bundled `clj`; activate across `py`, `js`, `php`, `clj` in one coordinated bump. | **One batched bump** | Unit tests for `yrt.*` on semantic/stack/register VMs; bundled/linked `yang.clojure` parity with source-defined `(defn get ...)` and active nested `try`/`throw`/`finally` frames; existing Python & PHP generator tests green; 4→5-slot migration tests; PHP `abandon-to` / `call-terminal` & normal `finally` replacement (`:py/None`, `:js/undefined`, `:php/null`, `nil`); `1.1 ** 6` bit-pattern parity (`fpow-half-raw` vs `fpow-base-raw`); exceptional `yrt.float` underflow (`0.5 ** -2000` -> `:yrt.float/underflow` + outer overflow policy), subnormal (`2.0 ** -1074` -> `5e-324`), normal zero (`2.0 ** -2000` -> `+0.0`), and out-of-range (`floor(1e30)`, `floor(NaN)`, `floor(Inf)`) witnesses under `%capture`/safepoints across 4 hosts; `yin.vm.integer` v4 three-reason translation without masking operational throws; independent concurrent `py`/`js`/`php`/`clj` tasks sharing `yrt.*`; bundled == linked + 4-host + CPython/Node/PHP oracle parity; `clj ./bin/analyze-deps.clj` clean. |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
