ndments:** This document settles owner decision A12.5 of `yang.typescript.md` §19 (the deferred `yrt` shared prelude lift) and extends `yang.antlr.md` §3.1/§3.4/§9.3 to treat preludes as **composable runtime modules** and **swappable frontend libraries** (enabling, for example, `yang.python` syntax compiled against a `clojure.core` semantics prelude). It adds no UAST node type, no VM opcode, no manifest schema version, and no closed language registry.\n    17\t\n    18\t---\n   342\tA semantics descriptor contains **only portable data** (satisfies `yang.frontend/non-portable-path`):\n   343\t\n   344\t```clojure\n   345\t{:yang.semantics/schema 1\n   346\t :yang.semantics/id :yang.python/clojure-core-v1\n   347\t :yang.semantics/syntax :python\n   348\t :yang.semantics/prelude-module 'clj.py\n   349\t :yang.semantics/ambient-modules\n   350\t [{:module 'yang.call,     :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   351\t  {:module 'yrt.escape,    :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   352\t  {:module 'yrt.float,     :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   353\t  {:module 'yrt.int,       :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   354\t  {:module 'clj,           :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   355\t  {:module 'clj.bridge,    :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   356\t  {:module 'clojure.core,  :address \"<blake3-address>\"}\n   357\t  {:module 'clj.py,        :address \"<blake3-address>\"}]\n   358\t\n   359\t :yang.semantics/capabilities\n   360\t {:mutation/locals      :cell          ;; :cell | :single-assignment | :refused\n   361\t  :mutation/subscript   :refused       ;; :supported | :refused\n   362\t  :mutation/attribute   :refused\n   363\t  :mutation/delete      :refused\n   364\t  :scope/global         :supported     ;; per-module globals cell only\n   365\t  :scope/nonlocal       :supported     ;; lexical cells when :mutation/locals is :cell\n   366\t  :calls/positional     :supported\n   367\t  :calls/varargs        :supported     ;; *args\n   368\t  :calls/defaults       :refused\n   369\t  :calls/kwonly         :refused\n   370\t  :calls/kwstar         :refused\n   371\t  :calls/kwargs         :refused\n   372\t  :destructuring/unpack :refused       ;; explicit choice; or :supported via clj.py/unpack\n   373\t  :expr/comprehensions  :supported     ;; eager list/set/dict only; genexpr gated by :control/generators\n   374\t  :control/exceptions   :supported     ;; bare `except:` + `finally` + `raise` (`except Exc as e:` requires :control/except-typed; `except as e:` is invalid Python 3 grammar)\n   375\t  :control/except-typed :refused       ;; class-matched / typed `except ExcType [as e]:` refused when :oo/classes :refused\n   376\t  :control/generators   :refused       ;; gates BOTH `yield`/`yield from` AND generator expressions\n   377\t  :control/with         :refused\n   378\t  :oo/classes           :refused\n   379\t  :modules/import       :ambient-only} ;; :supported | :ambient-only | :refused\n   380\t\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
